 "name_en": "Customer Consignment (1IU)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customer Consignment (1IU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scenario, the goods are initially posted to the customer consignment stock and thus remain the property of the company (consignment fill-up).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">At regular intervals, the customer reports how many articles are sold and how many articles are in the current stock (inventory). When the inventory is performed, the batch number may be entered to do a correct material posting. A corresponding sales order is entered that documents the issue from the customer consignment, meaning that the goods are no longer the property of the company (consignment issue).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Goods that are not required can be returned from the consignment stock to the central warehouse. The goods must not be defective. They are posted directly into the free stock (consignment pick-up).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In some cases, goods are returned to the customer consignment stock (by its own customer or based on erroneous consumption posting) after the consignment issue has already taken place. A return order is then created (consignment return).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Fill up the consignment stock assigned to the customer (consignment fill-up)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Issue from the consignment stock (consignment issue)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Return materials from the external customer consignment stock to the company warehouse (consignment pick-up)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Return order to the consignment stock (consignment return)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Save costs on inventory for consignor</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Restock as it sells – beneficial for both parties</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save time for consignor</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use the consignment stock to generate product exposure (especially new or unknown products) for their customers</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>客户寄售 (1IU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此场景中，货物最初过账到客户托运库存，因此仍然是公司的财产（托运补货）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">客户定期报告销售多少商品，以及当前库存（库存）中有多少商品。执行库存时，可以输入批次编号以执行正确的物料过账。输入记录客户寄售发货的相应销售订单，这意味着货物不再是公司的财产（寄售发货）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">不需要的货物可以从寄售库存退回至中央仓库。货物不得有缺陷。它们将直接过账到自由库存（寄售拣配）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在某些情况下，在寄售发货发生后，货物将退回到客户寄售库存（由其自己的客户或基于错误的消耗过账）。然后创建退货订单（寄售退货）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">填充分配给客户的寄售库存（寄售补货）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从寄售库存发货（寄售发货）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将物料从外部客户寄售库存退回到公司仓库（寄售拣配）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">退货订单到寄售库存（寄售退货）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioac7e91dd76184cc9b9e522c7f02da6e9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">节省发货方的库存成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">随销售补货 - 双方受益</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">节省发货方的时间</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用寄售库存为客户生成产品敞口（尤其是新产品或未知产品）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
